(211, 19, 0, 16, 'Drefy Duffle Bag', 'Drefy', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/updated-images/drefy/drefy-325991933-1692795655.JPG', '<ul><li>Stylish and Durable: Made from high-quality PU leather, this duffle bag boasts a stylish appearance while being tough enough to withstand travel demands.</li><li>Spacious Interior: The weekender bag offers ample space to pack your essentials, making it suitable for short trips or as a gym duffle bag.</li><li>Compact Design: Despite its roomy interior, the bag maintains a compact and manageable size, making it convenient for carrying and storing.</li><li>Comfortable to Carry: Equipped with comfortable handles, a detachable shoulder strap, or even a crossbody option, ensuring different carrying preferences are accommodated.</li><li>Versatile Use: Ideal for various occasions - from travel and weekend getaways to gym sessions and more, providing versatility in its usage.</li></ul>', '', 2349.00, 2349.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, 'public/uploads/product/updated-images/drefy/drefy-19686734-1700742714.jpg', 'all', 'drefy-duffle-bag', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1411, '2026-01-20 23:34:23', 0, 0, 1, '2023-08-10 22:03:47', '2026-01-20 23:34:23'),
