(232, 9, 0, 9, '100% Cotton Polo Neck Half Sleeve Striper T-Shirt', 'OP 936B', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1707307758.1.jpg', '<ul><li>Crafted from 100% cotton, this t-shirt ensures utmost comfort and breathability, making it ideal for all-day wear.&nbsp;</li><li>The regular fit design offers a perfect balance of comfort and style, allowing for ease of movement without compromising on the silhouette.&nbsp;</li><li>The classic polo neck design adds a touch of sophistication to your casual ensemble, making it versatile for various occasions from casual outings to semi-formal gatherings</li><li>Featuring half sleeves, this t-shirt provides a blend of coverage and ventilation, making it suitable for both warm and cool weather conditions.</li><li>The subtle yet stylish stripper pattern detailing on the t-shirt adds a trendy and unique element to your outfit, elevating your casual look effortlessly.</li></ul>', '', 749.00, 749.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, 'public/uploads/product/updated-images/oa-936b/oa-936b-2009273380-1707307840.jpg', 'all', '100-cotton-polo-neck-half-sleeve-striper-t-shirt-oa-936b', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1954, '2024-11-09 17:14:00', 0, 0, 0, '2024-02-08 00:39:18', '2024-11-09 18:32:36'),
