(248, 6, 0, 9, 'ONN Platina Men\'s Microfiber Brief', 'OP 981', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742559312.2 (1).jpg', '<p>The ONN Platina Men\'s Microfiber Brief offers pure luxury on the skin with its soft, smooth, and lightweight fabric. Designed for ultimate comfort, the microfiber material ensures a snug fit while remaining breathable and gentle against the skin. Perfect for everyday wear, these briefs provide a sleek, modern look and are ideal for those who prioritize both comfort and style. With their premium feel and superior quality, the ONN Platina Men\'s Microfiber Briefs are a must-have for anyone seeking the perfect combination of luxury and practicality.</p>', '', 450.00, 450.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-platina-mens-microfiber-brief-op-981', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-21 23:45:12', '2025-03-21 23:46:23'),
(249, 11, 0, 9, 'Platina Men\'s Microfiber Trunk', 'OP 982', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742560442.2 (3).jpg', '<p>The ONN Platina Men\'s Microfiber Trunk offers pure luxury on the skin with its ultra-soft, smooth microfiber fabric. Designed for maximum comfort, it provides a perfect fit that feels lightweight and breathable throughout the day. The modern trunk style offers a sleek and supportive shape, making it ideal for everyday wear. With its premium material and exceptional comfort, the ONN Platina Men\'s Microfiber Trunk is a must-have for anyone seeking a blend of luxury, style, and all-day comfort.</p>', '', 499.00, 499.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'platina-mens-microfiber-trunk-op-982', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-22 00:04:02', '2025-03-22 00:04:19'),
(250, 15, 0, 18, 'ONN Men\'s Half Sleeve Round Neck Luxury Thermal Wear', 'OI 1521', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742808885.OI 1521.jpg', '<p>The ONN Men\'s Half Sleeve Round Neck Luxury Thermal Wear offers the perfect blend of comfort and warmth for colder seasons. Designed with soft, breathable fabric, it provides a snug fit without compromising on mobility. The half sleeve design is ideal for layering under shirts or jackets, while the round neck ensures a classic, versatile look. Crafted to retain body heat efficiently, this thermal wear is a must-have for staying cozy during chilly days, making it an essential addition to every man’s wardrobe. Enjoy all-day comfort with the luxury of ONN thermal wear.</p>', '', 510.00, 510.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-mens-half-sleeve-round-neck-luxury-thermal-wear-oi-1521', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-24 21:04:45', '2025-03-24 21:05:40'),
(251, 15, 0, 18, 'ONN Men\'s Half Sleeve Round Neck Luxury Thermal Wear', 'OI 1522', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742811884.OI 1522.jpg', '<p>The ONN Men\'s Full Sleeve Round Neck Luxury Thermal Wear is designed to provide superior warmth and comfort during the coldest months. Crafted with soft, high-quality fabric, it offers a snug fit that retains heat while ensuring breathability. The full-sleeve design and round neck provide extra coverage, making it ideal for layering under clothes or wearing alone. Its luxurious texture and modern style ensure that you stay cozy without compromising on fashion. Perfect for outdoor activities or casual wear, this thermal wear is a must-have for every wardrobe.</p>', '', 550.00, 550.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-mens-half-sleeve-round-neck-luxury-thermal-wear-oi-1522', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-24 21:54:44', '2025-03-24 22:26:05'),
(252, 15, 0, 18, 'ONN Men\'s Full Sleeve V-Neck Luxury Thermal Wear', 'OI 1523', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742813976.OI 1523.jpg', '<p>The ONN Men\'s Full Sleeve V Neck Luxury Thermal Wear is the perfect blend of comfort, warmth, and style. Made from premium, soft fabric, it offers exceptional insulation while allowing your skin to breathe. The full sleeves and V-neck design provide a sleek and modern look, making it an ideal choice for layering under shirts or jackets. Whether you\'re braving the cold outdoors or relaxing at home, this thermal wear ensures you stay warm and stylish. Its luxurious feel and durable construction make it an essential addition to your winter wardrobe.</p>', '', 550.00, 550.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-mens-full-sleeve-v-neck-luxury-thermal-wear-oi-1523', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-24 22:29:36', '2025-03-24 22:29:52'),
(253, 15, 0, 18, 'ONN Men\'s Luxury Thermal Trouser', 'OI 1526', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742816286.OI 1526.jpg', '<p>The ONN Men\'s Luxury Thermal Trouser is designed to offer superior warmth and comfort during chilly weather. Made with high-quality, soft fabric, it provides excellent insulation while ensuring breathability. The sleek design fits comfortably, making it perfect for layering under clothes or wearing alone. Ideal for both outdoor activities and casual wear, these thermal trousers combine functionality with style. Stay cozy and stylish all winter long with this essential piece of your cold-weather wardrobe.</p>', '', 550.00, 550.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-mens-luxury-thermal-trouser-oi-1526', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-24 23:08:06', '2025-03-24 23:08:19'),
(254, 15, 0, 18, 'ONN Women\'s 3/4th Sleeve Luxury Thermal Wear', 'OI 1541', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742818175.OI 1541.jpg', '<p>ONN women\'s 3/4th sleeve U-neck luxury thermal wear combines comfort and style. Crafted from high-quality materials, it offers warmth without compromising on breathability, making it perfect for colder seasons. The U-neck design adds a touch of elegance, while the 3/4th sleeves provide a flattering fit. Ideal for layering or wearing alone, this thermal wear is a must-have addition to any wardrobe, ensuring you stay cozy and chic during chilly weather. Perfect for everyday wear or casual outings, it’s a blend of luxury and practicality.</p>', '', 499.00, 499.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-womens-34th-sleeve-luxury-thermal-wear-oi-1541', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-24 23:39:35', '2025-03-24 23:40:03'),
(255, 10, 0, 17, 'ONN Men\'s Fashion Track Pants', 'OA 1151', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742984865.FRONT.jpg', '<p>ONN men\'s track pants are crafted from a cotton-rich fabric, offering the perfect balance of comfort and durability. Designed with moisture management technology, they keep you dry and fresh during intense activities. The lightweight design ensures ease of movement, making them ideal for workouts or casual wear. Whether you\'re hitting the gym or relaxing at home, these track pants provide a stylish, functional choice for any occasion. The modern cut and breathable material enhance performance and comfort, making them a must-have in your wardrobe.</p>', '', 899.00, 899.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-mens-fashion-track-pants-oa-1151', NULL, NULL, NULL, 554, '2025-06-20 13:29:19', 1, 0, 0, '2025-03-26 21:57:45', '2025-06-20 21:55:29'),
(256, 10, 0, 17, 'ONN Men\'s Fashion Track Pants', 'OA 1152', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742987125.FRONT (2).jpg', '<p>ONN men\'s track pants are crafted from a cotton-rich fabric, offering the perfect balance of comfort and durability. Designed with moisture management technology, they keep you dry and fresh during intense activities. The lightweight design ensures ease of movement, making them ideal for workouts or casual wear. Whether you\'re hitting the gym or relaxing at home, these track pants provide a stylish, functional choice for any occasion. The modern cut and breathable material enhance performance and comfort, making them a must-have in your wardrobe.</p>', '', 899.00, 899.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-mens-fashion-track-pants-oa-1152', NULL, NULL, NULL, 559, '2025-06-20 16:06:04', 1, 0, 0, '2025-03-26 22:35:25', '2025-06-20 21:55:45'),
(257, 12, 0, 17, 'ONN Men\'s Fashion Joggers', 'OA 1156', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742988396.FRONT (3).jpg', '<p>ONN men\'s fashion joggers are crafted from a cotton-rich fabric, providing a soft and breathable feel. The moisture management feature keeps you dry and comfortable, even during intense activity. With a lightweight design, these joggers offer flexibility and ease of movement. Practical side pockets add convenience, allowing you to carry small essentials. Whether for a workout or casual day out, these joggers combine style, comfort, and functionality, making them a must-have in any wardrobe.</p>', '', 950.00, 950.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-mens-fashion-joggers-oa-1156', NULL, NULL, NULL, 84, '2025-06-20 15:44:28', 1, 0, 0, '2025-03-26 22:56:36', '2025-06-20 21:56:00'),
